                <pb facs="0294" n="194" sameAs="frus:frus1920v03/pg194"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">812.00/24768: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Mexico</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Summerlin</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1920-11-11T16:00:00-06:36"><hi rendition="#italic">November 11,
                                1920—4 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received 10:06
                    p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>444. Foreign Office has confirmed the local press report that Colombia has
                    recognized the present Mexican régime.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Summerlin</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
